config BR2_PACKAGE_SUDERRA_KEYS
	bool "suderra-keys"
	default n
	help
	  Suderra OS imajı için gerekli public key/sertifika'ları
	  hedef rootfs'e kurar.

	  Kurulan dosyalar:
	  - /etc/rauc/keyring.pem        (RAUC bundle doğrulama)
	  - /etc/ssl/certs/suderra-ca.pem (Cloud broker mTLS CA)
	  - /etc/dm-verity/pubkey.pem    (verity root hash doğrulama)
	  - /etc/suderra/os-installer-payload.ed25519.pub
	  - /etc/suderra/os-update-manifest.ed25519.pub
	  - /etc/suderra/recovery-escrow.pub.pem (the public key the recovery
	    keys of /data are escrowed to, ADR-048 DEC-14.3; its private half
	    lives offline in the HSM)
	  - /etc/suderra/keys/<purpose>/<epoch>.pub for edge-release,
	    edge-provisioning, fleet-root and device-lifecycle (ADR-048
	    DEC-3.4): the dev/CI keys of SUDERRA_TRUST_ROOTS_DIR/edge on dev
	    images; on production images only keyids the P1 key ceremony
	    inventories (none yet, so none is pinned)

	  Anahtarlar SUDERRA_TRUST_ROOTS_DIR env var ile belirtilir.
	  DEV variant: ~/.suderra-keys/dev/
	  PROD variant: CI'da kısa-ömürlü HSM session'dan elde edilir ve
	  suderra-keys.profile dosyası "prod" içermelidir.
